     3728           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     3729       End.
     3730     End.
     3731     if c-f-gds-name <>  ?  then do :
     3732       c-f-gds-name:screen-value = string(goods.gds-name) .
     3733       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
     3734           ( line-counter( OutStream ) >= page-size( OutStream ) )          then DO:
     3735           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     3736       End.
