     5833     Display stream OutStream
     5834             with FRAME Zapas no-error .
     5835             DOWN stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas.
     5836             if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     5837             "ИТОГО"                            CHR(9)
     5838             "ПО ВСЕМ ОБЬЕКТАМ"                 CHR(9)
